WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.813
There are two checks: one reads only
files and runs on every pull request,

2
00:00:04.813 --> 00:00:07.962
the other runs against
the tenant on every plan.

3
00:00:07.962 --> 00:00:12.852
Most of the nine rules come straight from
Learn's limits: assign by object ID,

4
00:00:12.852 --> 00:00:16.874
never by group; no managed
identities; single-tenant apps only;

5
00:00:16.874 --> 00:00:20.738
and an object ID that really
is the enterprise application.

6
00:00:20.738 --> 00:00:24.972
The program adds its own: the
licensing decision must be recorded,

7
00:00:24.972 --> 00:00:29.990
every policy file stays report-only and
block-only, egress ranges stay narrow,

8
00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:35.450
and enforcement needs the security chief's
decision and a reviewed sign-in summary.
